{"id":"7ca92679e1a71b55","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension.md","title":"Unique extension to Tseitin variables","display":"lem-tseitin-unique-extension — Unique extension to Tseitin variables","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension","aliases":["72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension"],"display":"lem-tseitin-unique-extension — Unique extension to Tseitin variables","depends_on":["[[72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding]]"],"source_author":"Pavel Pudlák","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local lemma from Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; no numbered theorem claimed","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"local-proof-checked","source_statement_status":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished","source_proof_status":"Complete local existence and uniqueness proof by structural induction","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-tseitin-unique-extension — Unique extension to Tseitin variables"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9192b374640dde9c\" href=\"?note=9192b374640dde9c\" title=\"72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding\">72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Pavel Pudlák"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local lemma from Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; no numbered theorem claimed"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Complete local existence and uniqueness proof by structural induction"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_3\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{SF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 与门子句取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9192b374640dde9c\" href=\"?note=9192b374640dde9c\" title=\"72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding\">72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\operatorname{Var}(A)\">\\(V=\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\">\\(Q=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ B⟧_a\">\\(⟦ B⟧_a\\)</span> 为同一命题公式语法的递归求值，适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(B)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}(B)\\subseteq V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\rm cnf}\">\\(\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\)</span> 取该上游链的子句语义。赋值按函数图处理，故不交定义域上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cup\">\\(\\cup\\)</span> 为函数图并。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a:=a\\cup\\{\\langle q(B),⟦ B⟧_a\\rangle:B\\in\\operatorname{SF}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat a:=a\\cup\\{\\langle q(B),⟦ B⟧_a\\rangle:B\\in\\operatorname{SF}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q}\\land\n\\widehat a\\upharpoonright V=a\\land\\widehat a\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\Delta(A,q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q}\\land\n\\widehat a\\upharpoonright V=a\\land\\widehat a\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\Delta(A,q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q}\\;\n\\bigl((b\\upharpoonright V=a\\land b\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\Delta(A,q))\\to b=\\widehat a\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q}\\;\n\\bigl((b\\upharpoonright V=a\\land b\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\Delta(A,q))\\to b=\\widehat a\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是从 §8.4 定义子句构造得到的本地引理，不冒充原书编号结果。</p>\n<p>存在性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\cap Q=\\varnothing\">\\(V\\cap Q=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 单射，因此所给函数图没有冲突并恰有定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\cup Q\">\\(V\\cup Q\\)</span>。对每个子公式，赋给其新变量的值等于该公式值；门子句等价式保证全部定义子句为真。</p>\n<p>唯一性沿子公式树归纳。原子门强制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(q(p))=a(p)\">\\(b(q(p))=a(p)\\)</span>；否定、合取和析取门强制输出为已经确定的子公式值的相应布尔运算。因此每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(B)\">\\(q(B)\\)</span> 的值都被确定，连同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\upharpoonright V=a\">\\(b\\upharpoonright V=a\\)</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=\\widehat a\">\\(b=\\widehat a\\)</span>。空原变量集不会出现于本节点的无常元公式，但论证不需要假设其非空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"9192b374640dde9c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"9192b374640dde9c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_3$，$q$、$\\operatorname{SF}$、$\\Delta$ 与门子句取 [[72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding]]；$V=\\operatorname{Var}(A)$，$Q=\\operatorname{ran}(q)$，$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_3","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\operatorname{Var}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\operatorname{ran}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ B⟧_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}(B)\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\rm cnf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\cup","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat a:=a\\cup\\{\\langle q(B),⟦ B⟧_a\\rangle:B\\in\\operatorname{SF}(A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q}\\land\n\\widehat a\\upharpoonright V=a\\land\\widehat a\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\Delta(A,q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q}\\;\n\\bigl((b\\upharpoonright V=a\\land b\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\Delta(A,q))\\to b=\\widehat a\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"V\\cap Q=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"V\\cup Q","display":false},{"tex":"b(q(p))=a(p)","display":false},{"tex":"q(B)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\upharpoonright V=a","display":false},{"tex":"b=\\widehat a","display":false}],"bytes":2531,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension|lem-tseitin-unique-extension — Unique extension to Tseitin variables]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension|lem-tseitin-unique-extension — Unique extension to Tseitin variables]]"},{"id":"106706ac4e4b2fb3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,q,V,Q,\\widehat a,\\Delta,E^+,E^-$ 取 [[72-lem-tseitin-unique-extension]] 及其直接定义上游；$\\mathsf{Taut}$ 是该上游链中标准命题重言式集合，$\\operatorname{Sat},\\operatorname{Unsat}$ 为子句语义。"}],"outgoing":["9192b374640dde9c"]}